Tested-by: Devin Wittmayer <lucid_duck@justthetip.ca> # RTL8852AU (D-Link DWA-X1850 B1)
Tested-by: Devin Wittmayer <lucid_duck@justthetip.ca> # RTL8852BU (BrosTrend AX4L)
